 "description": "Lopez2014 - A Validated Mathematical Model of Tumor Growth Including Tumor-Host Interaction and Cell-Mediated Immune Response\nBioModels BIOMD0000000784 (curated). SBML file: Lopez2014.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 30 time units (SED-ML: Lopez2014.sedml), sampling 0.3.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 3.33e-06 of species peak (worst: z_Effector_Cells)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Tumor_Killing: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
